From 92849e3ce55468844fa0c8227c97b1bdbe2d0c0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeyKul <jey@kulovac.de>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:06:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] b0s: S-Boot direct-boot bring-up aids (fb bands/console, RAM
 log, SMC/HVC trace)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
